<title>DENMARK: Nordic Investment Bank issues 500 mln Dkk pct bond.</title>
<headline>Nordic Investment Bank issues 500 mln Dkk pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nordic Investment Bank on Friday announced the following issue.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Nordic Investment Bank  AMOUNT 500 MLN DKK</p>
<p>COUPON- 4 pct    MATURITY-2002   ISS DATE- 5 November 1996</p>
<p>ISS PRICE - To be advised</p>
<p>The bank said all bonds had already been allocated and gave no further details of the issue.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
</text>
